@switch INTERACT_VERB
@case "look"
	A pile of rocks.
	There are only a few of them, but there are also many of them.
@case "take"
	Taken.
	@do add_item "Rocks"
	You are now carrying an arbitrarily large number of rocks.
	The pile of rocks did not change size at all.
@case "kick"
	It made a satisfying sound.
	The pile of rocks did not change size at all.
@case else
	Cannot do.
